this place has four library rooms you'd think one of them would be quiet how are things in heaven mom

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:53.320
i can't believe it's been 10 years already i'm beginning to think that rich kids only

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:59.690
come to school to have a good time abandoned music room

