00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:38.990
The Oran Host Club is where the school's handsomest boys, with too much time on their hands, entertain young ladies who also have way too much time on their hands.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.980
Just think of it as Oran Academy's elegant playground for the super rich and beautiful.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.360
Host Club? Wow, it's a boy!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.500
Hikaru, Kauru, I believe this young man is in the same class as you, isn't he?

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.960
Yeah, but he's shy. He doesn't act very sociably, so we...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.020
I don't know much about him.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.880
Well, that wasn't very polite.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:08.800
Welcome to the Oron Host Club, Mr. Honor Student.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.030
What?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.420
You must be Haruhi Fujioka.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:15.340
You're the exceptional honor student we've heard about.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.980
How did you know my name?

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.160
Why, you're infamous.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.220
It's not every day that a commoner gains entrance

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.000
into our academy.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.960
You must have an audacious nerve

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.420
to work hard enough to fight your way

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.940
