00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:29.970
What?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.440
Well, uh, thank you, I guess.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.120
You're welcome!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.780
You're a hero to other poor people, Fujioka.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.300
You've shown the world that even a poor person

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.440
can excel at an elite private academy.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.280
It must be hard for you to constantly

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.840
