00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.720
Then who are you calling Haru-chan?!

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.820
I never would have imagined the famous scholar would be so openly gay.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:16.280
Openly what?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.890
So tell me what kind of guys you're into.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.910
Do you like the strong silent type?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.300
The boy Lolita?

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.460
How about the mischievous type?

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.380
Or the cool type?

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.680
I was just looking for a quiet place to study or maybe

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.730
You're into a guy like me

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:59.890
We were going to feature that Renaissance vase in an upcoming school auction. Oh now you've done it commoner the bidding on that vase was supposed to start it

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:10.800
million yen is that how many thousands are in a million uh i'm gonna have to pay you back with

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:16.580
what money you can't even afford a school uniform what's with that grubby outfit you've got on anyway

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:22.900
well what do you think we should do tomaki there's a famous saying you may have heard fujioka

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:29.940
when in rome you should do as the romans do since you have no money you can pay with your body

