00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:46.200
I've been captured by a bunch of boys that are calling themselves a host club.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.350
What's your favorite song?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.760
What song? The one that reminds me of you, of course.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:08.760
