00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.300
Only if you'll feed it to me, darling.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.870
Oh, you're so dreamy.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.590
May I have a word with you, Tamaki?

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:22.690
I've recently heard the host club is keeping a little kitten without a pedigree.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.250
Heh, I don't know if I'd call him that.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:29.980
Speak of the devil. Thanks for doing the shopping, little...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:39.280
piglet did you get everything on our list what piglet hey wait a minute what is this just what

