00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:37.330
I didn't mean to upset you, but you were so adorable when it happened, I had to tell them.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:38.320
I'm sorry.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.260
Forgive you.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:45.980
What are they so excited about?

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.300
I just don't get it.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.970
Ugh, sorry.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:50.780
We're running late.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.720
We've been waiting here for you guys.

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:57.410
I'm sorry.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.960
I was waiting for Takashi to finish his-

