I guess he is kind of cute, huh?

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:06.000
You'll notice that our club utilizes each man's unique characteristics to cater to the desires of our guests.

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.240
Just so you know, Tamaki is number one around here.

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:12.420
He's the king. His request rate is 70%.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.570
What's this world coming to?

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.830
And in order for you to pay off your 8 million yen debt with us,

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.120
you will act as the Oran host club's dog until you graduate.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.340
I'm sorry, I meant our errand boy.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.180
You can try to run away if you want to, Haruhi.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.980
But just so you know, my family employs a private police...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:38.880
force of 100 officers by the way do you have a passport huh you're going to have

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:46.770
to work hard to pay off that debt my little nerd please don't do that again

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:51.460
you need a makeover or no girl's going to look twice at you yeah well I'm not

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.400
trying to get girls to look at me are you kidding me it's the most important

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:59.970
thing you have to learn to be a gentleman and please the ladies like me

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:02.540
