00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.520
I mean, all that really matters is what's on the inside, right?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:12.840
I don't understand why you even have a host club like this.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:15.130
It's a cruel reality, isn't it?

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:19.300
It's not often that God creates a perfect person like moi,

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.380
beautiful both inside and out.

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:22.560
Say what?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:26.350
I understand how you feel since not everyone is blessed as I am,

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.550
but you must console yourself, otherwise how would you go on living?

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.220
And think about this, Haruhi.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.800
Why do you think they put works of art in museums?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.160
Because beauty should be shared with the world.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.420
And those born beautiful should promote other wonderful things.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.800
There's a word to describe people like him.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:41.760
That's why I started this club in the first place.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:43.880
I did it for those who are starved for beauty.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:44.580
What is it?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.320
For those working day and night pursuing beauty.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.260
And although your looks may have ridge and you know

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:51.740
I wish I could remember that word.

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:54.800
I've chosen to share my expertise with you.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:55.880
Here's a tip.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.220
When setting down your glass,

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:59.300
extend your pinky finger as a cushion.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:11:59.960
And that's...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.740
That way, when you set it down, you won't be making a lot of noise.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.780
Maybe... a pain in the neck?

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:11.780
No. There's something that fits in perfectly.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:17.420
But above all else, Haruhi, you must remember how effective a glance to the side can be.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:18.740
Huh. I got it.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.480
Oh, did I strike a crow?

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:20.780
Obnoxious.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:25.820
I'm sorry, Tamaki-senpai.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.220
You're a hero, all right.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.630
But he is a pain in the neck.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.950
I'm sorry, Senpai, but your lesson did strike a small chord with me.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:43.020
Really, it did? Let me teach you more, my friend.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:44.750
Well, we got over that quick.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:46.810
Boss, call me King.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.550
You can teach him all the basics of hosting,

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.770
but he's not going to get very far with the ladies if he doesn't look the part, you know.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:59.480
He's not exactly host club material, but maybe if we took off his glasses, it'll help.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.260
Hey, I need those.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.120
I used to have contacts, but I lost them on the first day of school.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:11.480
Hikaru.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.150
Kauru.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.100
Got it.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:13.880
Huh?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.700
Kyo-ya, my hairstylist.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.390
Mori-senpai, go to the eye doctor and get him some contact lenses.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:28.740
Ani-senpai.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.540
You, go have some cake.

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.910
It's just us, Susa-chan.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.860
Everyone else said they were too busy.

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.910
Here, change into this uniform.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.520
What? But what?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:44.900
Don't ask questions!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:45.780
No way!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.700
Okay, fine, I'll change, but you two have to get it!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.890
Um, senpai?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.760
Aren't you done changing yet?

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:12.700
You sure it's really okay for me to keep this uniform?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:17.360
You're as pretty as a girl! Adorable!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.710
If we had known that's how you really look,

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.250
we would have helped you out sooner.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.490
Who knows? Maybe he'll draw on some customers.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.980
You know, that's just what I was thinking.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:32.670
Our errand boy is moving up the ranks.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.250
Starting today, you are an official member of the host club.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.440
I will personally train you to be a first-rate host.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.200
If you can get 100 customers to request your service,

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.140
we will completely forget about your 8 million yen debt.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:45.650
A host?

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:54.020
Tell me, Haruhi.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.810
Do you have any hobbies?

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:56.650
What do you like to do?

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:57.700
I'm curious.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.820
What kind of products do you use on your skin?

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.410
Yes, it's so pretty.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:02.950
I can't do this anymore.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:06.240
I have no idea what I'm supposed to do.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.450
So why did you join the host club, Haruhi?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:14.180
Uh, all I have to do is get a hundred customers to request me

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.340
and they'll forget about my 8 million yen debt.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.720
I know just the story.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:24.320
I see. Your mother was sick and passed away 10 years ago.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.360
Who does the chores around the house?

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.230
Oh, I do them myself.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:29.970
My mother taught me.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:34.580
She was an amazing cook, and when she went to the hospital, she left me all kinds of great recipes.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:40.990
It was fun to create each dish, especially when they turned out well, and it made me happy to see my dad enjoy it.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:45.440
I've had a hard childhood, but Dad and I have managed to make it through okay.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.480
Is it okay if tomorrow we request to sit with you again?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.520
Yeah, I really appreciate that, ladies.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:54.240
Why is he so popular?

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.300
He's a natural.

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.560
No training needed.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:58.400
Have you forgotten about me?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:06.000
Oh no, sorry Princess. I'm just a little bit concerned about our newest host.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:10.040
Well, that's obvious, Tamaki. You sure have been keeping an eye on him.

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:14.160
Of course I have to. I'm training him to be a gentleman like me.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.950
Haruhi, come here for a minute.

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:19.570
What's up?

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.210
I'd like you to meet someone.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.560
This is my regular guest, Princess Ayanokoji.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:27.030
It's that girl from earlier.

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.100
Miss, it's a pleasure to meet you.

00:16:31.596 --> 00:16:32.256
So cute!

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.280
Eric Bashford, this was very good, super good.

00:16:37.388 --> 00:16:39.388
Oh, you're so cute!

00:16:39.388 --> 00:16:40.388
What is it?

00:16:50.156 --> 00:16:51.276
Mori Senpai?

00:16:51.596 --> 00:16:53.436
You really didn't have to go that far.

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:56.760
Come on, little one, let Daddy give you a big hug.

00:16:57.164 --> 00:16:59.304
I've already got a dad. I don't need another one.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.370
Hey, what happened to my bag?

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:10.060
Are you kidding me?

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:12.000
But how did that happen?

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.770
I didn't think there were bullies at this school.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.350
Hmm, guess they're everywhere.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:25.110
Oh, it's you again.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:29.840
I bet you love having Tamaki making you over and fawning over you.

00:17:30.476 --> 00:17:33.856
It's useless, though. You're always going to be a second-class citizen.

00:17:40.364 --> 00:17:43.204
I have a feeling that girl's the one who threw my bag in the pond.

00:17:43.948 --> 00:17:45.628
I can't be bothered with her right now, though.

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:49.120
Gotta find my wallet or I won't have any money for food this week.

00:17:49.388 --> 00:17:50.388
Hey, commoner.

00:17:50.988 --> 00:17:53.588
You've got some nerve skipping out on the club like that.

00:17:55.148 --> 00:17:56.448
Why is your bag all wet?

00:17:57.196 --> 00:17:59.196
Uh, it's no big deal. I got it.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.840
I just can't find my food money.

00:18:02.396 --> 00:18:03.236
Mm-hmm.

00:18:08.252 --> 00:18:10.872
Hey, you don't have to do that. You'll get wet.

00:18:11.032 --> 00:18:12.492
A little water never hurt anyone.

00:18:13.596 --> 00:18:16.756
Besides, people are always telling me that I'm dripping with good looks.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:20.940
